Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.25,0:00:10.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好想快點孵出來啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.80,0:00:13.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始買給我的蛋\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.55,0:00:15.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,都說是幸運之蛋了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.30,0:00:18.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,一定會孵出超厲害的東西啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.60,0:00:28.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好 出發吧 龍！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.66,0:00:38.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,果然要照顧很麻煩 吃掉算了吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.87,0:00:39.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.74,0:00:41.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎麼可以說這種話！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.49,0:00:42.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,絕對不行！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.91,0:00:45.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這可是幸運之蛋！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.12,0:00:48.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,一定會孵出一隻了不起的龍\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.46,0:00:50.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,絕對會的啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.46,0:00:52.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這樣啊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.14,0:01:01.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,龍龍…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.16,0:01:25.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,龍要…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.55,0:01:38.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始 有個小小的東西跑出來了啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.68,0:01:39.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這是？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.72,0:01:44.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,早餐？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.81,0:01:46.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.35,0:01:48.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始腦子裡就只想著吃！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.98,0:01:51.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你可沒資格說這種話！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:13.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（29歲單身中堅冒險家的日常）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.33,0:03:25.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（第5話 孵化出來的是）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.91,0:03:27.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,早安！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.58,0:03:32.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好可愛的孩子！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.29,0:03:35.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真的 蛋孵出來了呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.59,0:03:37.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,對呀！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.59,0:03:39.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,牠是龍！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.55,0:03:43.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你是在說名字吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.93,0:03:45.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎麼看都只是麻雀鳥吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.77,0:03:51.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（（麻雀鳥 住在山裡的大型鳥\n早上啾啾叫的是牠的鳴聲 大小比較））\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.00,0:04:14.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可愛就好啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.21,0:04:16.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.21,0:04:19.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,反正女生都愛可愛的東西嘛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.80,0:04:24.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（其實他偷偷想 等下可不可以摸一下）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.64,0:04:28.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,說起來我以前也養過寵物耶\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.26,0:04:32.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,竟然還有心力養寵物喔？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.68,0:04:34.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,您以前養了什麼呢？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.52,0:04:36.94,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,龍？一定是龍吧 始！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.73,0:04:40.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是不知不覺住進貧民窟的一隻狗啦…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.40,0:04:43.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,很聰明的傢伙\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.49,0:04:48.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有空我就教牠各種把戲\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.62,0:04:54.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不過有段時間一直下雨\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.46,0:04:56.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,接不太到什麼任務\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.13,0:04:59.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,連續兩三天幾乎沒得吃\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.32,0:05:23.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那時候真是救了我啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.32,0:05:27.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始先生…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.74,0:05:30.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露 你要好好盯著那孩子喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.33,0:05:34.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,來吧 今天吃什麼好呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.51,0:05:47.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要加油派上用場喔 龍！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.43,0:05:53.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那個叫做史萊姆\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.56,0:05:56.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,牠對聲音有反應 所以要安靜喔？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.15,0:06:02.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,欸欸 安靜點 龍！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.53,0:06:05.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我都說了要安靜\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.71,0:06:22.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那個啊… 始…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.50,0:06:23.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這個是…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.25,0:06:25.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,因為叫聲太大\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.51,0:06:28.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,看來牠不太擅長對付史萊姆呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.85,0:06:33.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,看起來是這樣！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.02,0:06:39.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 沒生氣\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.23,0:06:43.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始也覺得龍很可愛呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.86,0:06:50.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,他是在確認肉質嫩不嫩嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.36,0:06:51.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,還把手套脫了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.49,0:06:58.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,龍！今天你要在家看家喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.16,0:06:59.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要乖乖的喔！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.92,0:07:09.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,把眼珠交出來！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.55,0:07:12.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,因為龍不擅長對付史萊姆\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.93,0:07:15.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就由莉露來努力吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.40,0:07:30.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（莉露升級到等級3了）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.32,0:07:33.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我回來了喔 龍！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.96,0:07:43.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這是怎麼回事！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.58,0:07:44.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那個\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.71,0:07:45.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.04,0:07:50.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那塊肉 居然在我的床上大便！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.34,0:07:53.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始 這孩子的名字…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.14,0:07:56.39,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是叫肉 是叫龍…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.55,0:07:59.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,隨便啦…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.43,0:08:00.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.48,0:08:09.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,來 龍！加油！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.28,0:08:18.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不行啦！不能一直跌倒喔 龍！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.70,0:08:21.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,小龍應該辦不到吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.71,0:08:24.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可是 如果派不上用場\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.75,0:08:26.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就會被始吃掉啦…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.17,0:08:30.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,以前或許會 現在始是很像樣的冒險者了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.63,0:08:34.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,他不會做那種事的 對吧始先生？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.77,0:08:43.02,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,來 加油！小龍！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.10,0:08:45.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要小心不要晃出來喔！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.35,0:08:47.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,很棒喔 就是這樣\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.06,0:08:51.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,如果要我幫忙料理 我可不要…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.57,0:08:54.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露 工作囉\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.90,0:08:56.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,知道啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.53,0:08:58.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天是村莊周邊的警備\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.71,0:09:09.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼 怎樣啦？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.21,0:09:12.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,沒事啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.85,0:09:24.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,喂\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.65,0:09:32.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,路上小心！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.28,0:09:33.94,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,龍！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.19,0:09:35.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天要以莉露為榜樣\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.15,0:09:38.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,一定學會怎樣工作喔！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.70,0:09:41.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我也會幫忙 一起加油喔！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.29,0:09:49.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,老是在大便啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.08,0:09:51.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你這是拿命開玩笑耶 龍！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.55,0:10:02.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,龍啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.65,0:10:11.69,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可惡 又是大便喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.44,0:10:17.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,難不成\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.86,0:10:20.49,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這是兔熊的…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.95,0:10:24.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,照理說這座山不該有牠們的蹤跡才對…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.21,0:10:29.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要是築巢就麻煩了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.38,0:10:32.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好 追蹤行蹤 莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.38,0:10:34.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,別跟丟了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.55,0:10:41.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,還真是不順…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.05,0:10:46.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這樣對折一次 再這樣 這樣\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.85,0:10:49.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就這樣摺起來喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.40,0:10:53.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,原來如此好 來做做看吧龍！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.90,0:11:00.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,對對對 很厲害\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.45,0:11:02.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不錯喔龍！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.37,0:11:06.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不可以！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.95,0:11:09.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,龍 你在幹嘛啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.87,0:11:15.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,沒關係啦 重洗一次就好了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.76,0:11:19.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是兔熊嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.13,0:11:23.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,對 不過還沒完全找出來\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.76,0:11:26.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,牠們繁殖很快 也會襲擊人\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.81,0:11:28.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,最好增殖前就先清除掉呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.48,0:11:33.02,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,話說回來 為什麼會出現在這附近\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.81,0:11:37.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,最近天冷 山裡的樹果跟水果歉收…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.65,0:11:42.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,為了覓食才遠遠跑來 應該是這樣吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.49,0:11:44.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,東雲先生\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.87,0:11:47.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,能否作為公會的正式委託\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.41,0:11:52.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,請你負責兔熊的搜索與討伐呢？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.67,0:11:53.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,啥？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.79,0:11:56.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.96,0:12:02.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（29歲單身中堅冒險家的日常）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.69,0:12:18.69,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,娜塔莉 你怎麼了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.90,0:12:19.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,還好嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.99,0:12:22.49,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.91,0:12:26.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我完全沒事啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.33,0:12:31.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你看就這樣！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.54,0:12:33.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,娜塔莉 今天去休息\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.25,0:12:35.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你是累過頭了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.84,0:12:37.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可是\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.25,0:12:40.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,剛好要進旺季了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.96,0:12:43.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,得趁現在把工作先做完\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.84,0:12:47.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不行 你也很清楚生病的可怕吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.18,0:12:55.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那… 今天娜塔莉的工作\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.15,0:12:57.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就由莉露和龍來代班！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.40,0:13:03.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝你們\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.74,0:13:06.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不過這是我的工作\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.53,0:13:07.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,應該由我來做\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.78,0:13:11.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦好啦 他們會努力完成的啦？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.54,0:13:15.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可是… 這是我的工作…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.71,0:13:19.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,別管了 你就先休息啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.93,0:13:27.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你看吧… 就是逞強才會這樣\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.00,0:13:59.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,龍 要小心點喔？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.51,0:14:13.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那個是娜塔莉的午餐嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.85,0:14:14.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,對\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.81,0:14:16.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露送過去吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.56,0:14:19.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這樣啊… 那就拜託你了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.65,0:14:29.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽 娜塔莉打掃厲害嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.66,0:14:31.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,很厲害喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.57,0:14:33.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,娜塔莉好棒喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.04,0:14:36.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝你幫忙喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.12,0:14:40.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,娜塔莉會更努力的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.05,0:14:50.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,一感冒…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.05,0:14:53.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,心就會變得脆弱呢…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.01,0:14:57.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好寂寞…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.98,0:15:00.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.81,0:15:02.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,還好嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.28,0:15:07.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露你什麼時候在那的…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.61,0:15:08.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,剛剛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.45,0:15:12.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是你媽媽真抱歉 你很寂寞對吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.82,0:15:15.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,沒… 沒有啦莉露！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.20,0:15:18.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我媽媽三年前就去世了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.16,0:15:22.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,現在是因為感冒人有點虛 就是這樣…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.83,0:15:23.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,懂嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.96,0:15:26.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要不要讓我摸摸頭？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.88,0:15:28.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真的沒事啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.01,0:15:31.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要不要吸奶？雖然吸不出來…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.47,0:15:32.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不用啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.10,0:15:38.02,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露 還有小龍\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.31,0:15:39.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天謝謝你們\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.60,0:15:41.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,別客氣娜塔莉\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.56,0:15:43.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你要快點康復才行喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.15,0:15:47.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,而且幫忙之後 我也知道娜塔莉的工作\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.69,0:15:50.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真的很不容易呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.86,0:15:53.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,雖然有時候確實辛苦…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.91,0:15:56.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但我想成為冒險者們的後盾\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.53,0:15:57.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,所以做得也開心\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.20,0:15:59.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,冒險者的後盾？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.16,0:16:00.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,對\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.37,0:16:04.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我能做的 大概就是\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.50,0:16:08.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,把旅館打理得乾淨 讓大家能好好休息\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.88,0:16:10.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,為了這個工作\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.72,0:16:12.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我一天也不想偷懶\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.30,0:16:17.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,娜塔莉\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.89,0:16:19.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,一定會是很好的新娘子\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.89,0:16:21.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你… 你突然說什麼啦？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.81,0:16:23.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不過\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.31,0:16:25.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始不行喔？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.37,0:16:40.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真傷腦筋啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.45,0:16:43.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,明天再找一次看看\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.79,0:16:46.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不然改交給嗅覺比較好的 獸化者會快一點\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.46,0:16:48.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,說的也是呢…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.38,0:16:54.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要怎麼辦才好…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.93,0:16:57.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那個叫兔熊的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.30,0:16:59.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,很難找到嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.68,0:17:02.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我長年都在地下城裡打滾啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.23,0:17:06.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,在大自然裡追蹤獵物的經驗不太夠\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.52,0:17:11.94,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始也有做不好的事啊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.20,0:17:23.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天天氣真好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.41,0:17:26.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,看來你恢復得不錯嘛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.62,0:17:29.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始先生 早安！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.05,0:17:31.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,多虧莉露他們\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.80,0:17:33.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我好好休息了呢！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.72,0:17:34.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那就好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.01,0:17:35.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.14,0:17:39.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天莉露也要一起去！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.97,0:17:42.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我還要忙著找兔熊呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.81,0:17:44.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你今天也去幫娜塔莉吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.19,0:17:46.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露身為冒險者\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.98,0:17:49.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要做好自己的工作！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.44,0:17:52.69,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始跟娜塔莉都在努力工作！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.78,0:17:54.69,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露也不會輸的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.99,0:18:00.99,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那就別扯我後腿喔？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.66,0:18:03.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是那隻烤小鳥\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.75,0:18:08.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是啦 是龍！是龍啦始！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.21,0:18:11.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,路上小心 冒險者先生\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.96,0:18:13.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我們出發囉！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.10,0:18:30.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這道爪痕…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.19,0:18:34.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,說是兔熊抓的也太低了吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.53,0:18:41.12,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,龍！你要跑去哪啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.37,0:18:43.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,給我回來！龍！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.54,0:18:45.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是吵死了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.41,0:18:48.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,等等我啦 龍！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.33,0:18:50.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.54,0:18:53.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,龍！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.97,0:18:59.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好多龍喔！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.01,0:19:01.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是麻雀鳥\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.72,0:19:04.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是因為感覺到同伴在才跑起來的嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.61,0:19:19.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼突然這麼吵\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.80,0:19:38.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,喂！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.26,0:19:44.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你要去哪裡啦 龍！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.01,0:19:46.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,喂！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.73,0:19:58.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是兔熊啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.32,0:20:00.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真的假的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.32,0:20:03.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,所以剛才那一大串吵死人的叫聲\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.87,0:20:06.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是為了打聽兔熊的情報…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.45,0:20:07.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那隻烤小鳥…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.70,0:20:10.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,幹得好啊 龍！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.75,0:20:12.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,接下來就交給…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.75,0:20:14.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露就行啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.38,0:20:19.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.43,0:20:32.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這樣就解決了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.44,0:20:36.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始！龍有幫上忙嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.73,0:20:39.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有 幫大忙了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.78,0:20:42.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,麻雀鳥在這附近到處都有\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.78,0:20:45.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,能從牠們那拿到情報真是太好了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.49,0:20:51.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,老實說比你還有用耶！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.50,0:21:01.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露 你還好嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.55,0:21:02.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我沒事…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.92,0:21:05.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我要更努力 比龍還有用！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.51,0:21:08.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,讓你久等啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.89,0:21:11.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你少講一句不好嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.89,0:21:15.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,失禮了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.10,0:21:18.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這裡有位叫薇洛妮卡的女性嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.07,0:21:20.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,塔尼婭\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.65,0:21:24.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎麼跑到這裡來了？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.24,0:21:26.82,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,出了必須稟報的事\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.07,0:21:29.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什麼事呀？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.83,0:21:32.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,薇洛妮卡大人的店魅魔之羽\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.83,0:21:34.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,倒閉了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.31,0:23:19.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,利夏特大人！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.24,0:23:32.32,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就由我來做個了斷…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.57,0:23:33.74,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,薇洛妮卡！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.12,0:23:40.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（下回 決戰！地下城攻略）\n
